## 🎬 Video Ad Scripts (Reels/Shorts - 15-30s)

### Script 1: The Construction Site (Fast-paced)
*(Visual: A busy building material supplier standing near a truck loaded with cement)*
**Actor:** *(Looking stressed)* Roz 50 delivery, 100 payment... diary mein likhne ka time hi nahi hai!
*(Visual: Pulls out phone, opens BaahiAI)*
**Actor:** BaahiAI pe bas bol deta hu: *"Sharma ji ko 200 bag cement bheja, usne 5000 advance bhi de diya."*
*(Visual: Screen recording of BaahiAI instantly creating a Delivery Card and an Advance Card)*
**Actor:** Ho gaya! Delivery bhi record, payment bhi record. Typing zero. Hisaab 100% pakka. Try karo BaahiAI!

### Script 2: The "Ask the App" Magic
*(Visual: Businessman drinking morning tea, looking relaxed)*
**Actor:** Roz subah main apna hisaab check nahi karta... main apne app se baatein karta hu.
*(Visual: Screen shows chat interface)*
**Audio (Voiceover):** *"Kal ka kitna collection aana baaki hai?"*
*(Visual: AI types back instantly: "You have ₹45,000 pending collection today from 3 customers...")*
**Actor:** Hindi, Marathi, Gujarati... kuch bhi bolo, BaahiAI samajhta hai. Download the smart ledger today.

