## 🖼️ Required Ad Creatives (Images/Carousels)

1. **The "Split Card" Carousel:**
   - Slide 1: A voice waveform graphic + Text: "Bol ke entry karo:" → "Manish bhai e aaj 10 ton sariya moklavyu, ane 20,000 advance apyu"
   - Slide 2: Arrow pointing to the two outputs 🧠 Delivery Card & 💰 Payment Card.
2. **Language Collage:** A graphic showing the "Mic" button surrounded by text bubbles in Marathi, Hindi, Gujarati, Tamil, etc., with the headline: "Aapki Bhasha, Aapka Hisaab."
3. **The AI Chat UI Mockup:** A gorgeous, clean mockup of the chat screen showing the prompt *"Remind me next Friday to call Ramesh"*, and the AI instantly setting an alarm card.

